- **Library Management:** Ensure the OpenSSL library is kept up-to-date to incorporate the latest security patches and improvements.
- **No Predictable Randomness:** If any random number generation were to be introduced (e.g., for salts, though not present in this specific function), ensure it uses a cryptographically secure random number generator seeded with high-entropy data.
